  "description": "We are generating a Swagger definition from our Web\u202fAPI project located in **bin/MyApi.dll**, with an additional reference to **lib/SomeDependency.dll**. The process uses the NuGet cache (true) and targets ASP.NET\u202fCore (true). Only the controllers **WeatherForecastController** and **ValuesController** are included, and the default URL template is set to `api/{controller}/{id}`. Property names are formatted in **CamelCase**, while enumerations are rendered as **String** values. The inheritance hierarchy is not flattened (false), known types are generated (true), XML object generation is disabled (false), and missing path parameters are added (true). The Swagger metadata carries the title **My\u202fAPI** and version **v1**, and no specific output file is defined (output is null).  \n\nFor the client side we have two generators. The C# client is placed in the **MyCompany.Api.Client** namespace, uses **DateTimeOffset** for dates, does not wrap DTO exceptions (false), and follows a single\u2011client\u2011per\u2011path\u2011segment strategy. It generates clone methods, default values, and excludes the types **IEnumerable** and **Task**. References are handled (true), no constructor interface is generated (false), and required types are imported from **Some.Namespace**. The base\u2011URL token is named **BaseUrl**, the output file is **Generated/Client.cs**, and the generated class is called **ApiClient**. DTO types, client interfaces, client classes, and optional parameters are all produced (true), response wrapping is off (false) with the methods **GetAsync** and **PostAsync** marked for wrapping, response classes are not generated (false), and the response wrapper class is **ApiResponse**.  \n\nThe TypeScript client also lives in the **MyCompany.Api.Client** namespace, but uses **Date** for dates. It shares the same settings as the C# client for DTO exception wrapping (false), operation generation mode (single client from path segments), clone method generation, default values, excluded type names (**IEnumerable**, **Task**), reference handling, and base\u2011URL token (**BaseUrl**). The generated file is **src/api.service.ts**, the class name is **ApiService**, and it also generates DTO types, client interfaces, client classes, and optional parameters. Response wrapping is disabled (false) with the methods **get** and **post** marked for wrapping, no response classes are generated (false), and the response wrapper is again **ApiResponse**. Additional TypeScript\u2011specific settings include the **Angular** template, **Promise** as the promise type, a base class of **BaseApiClient**, a configuration class named **ApiConfiguration**, and transformation of options enabled (true) while result transformation is disabled (false). A protected method **getAuthToken** is declared, the client uses a\u202f**GetBaseUrl** method, treats a null query value as the string \u201cnull\u201d, and employs **HttpClient** for HTTP calls. It targets RxJS version\u202f6, does not use a singleton provider (false), and uses **InjectionToken** for injection tokens. Optional properties are marked (true), the TypeScript version is\u202f4.5, the module name is **my\u2011api\u2011client**, null values are rendered as \u201cnull\u201d, and the generated types follow a **Class** style.",
  "reference_json": {
    "swaggerGenerator": {
      "webApiToSwagger": {
        "assemblyPaths": [
          "bin/MyApi.dll"
        ],
        "referencePaths": [
          "lib/SomeDependency.dll"
        ],
        "useNuGetCache": true,
        "isAspNetCore": true,
        "controllerNames": [
          "WeatherForecastController",
          "ValuesController"
        ],
        "defaultUrlTemplate": "api/{controller}/{id}",
        "defaultPropertyNameHandling": "CamelCase",
        "defaultEnumHandling": "String",
        "flattenInheritanceHierarchy": false,
        "generateKnownTypes": true,
        "generateXmlObjects": false,
        "addMissingPathParameters": true,
        "infoTitle": "My API",
        "infoVersion": "v1",
        "output": null
      }
    },
    "codeGenerators": {
      "swaggerToCSharpClient": {
        "namespace": "MyCompany.Api.Client",
        "dateTimeType": "DateTimeOffset",
        "wrapDtoExceptions": false,
        "operationGenerationMode": "SingleClientFromPathSegments",
        "generateCloneMethod": true,
        "generateDefaultValues": true,
        "excludedTypeNames": [
          "IEnumerable",
          "Task"
        ],
        "handleReferences": true,
        "generateConstructorInterface": false,
        "importRequiredTypes": "Some.Namespace",
        "baseUrlTokenName": "BaseUrl",
        "output": "Generated/Client.cs",
        "className": "ApiClient",
        "generateDtoTypes": true,
        "generateClientInterfaces": true,
        "generateClientClasses": true,
        "generateOptionalParameters": true,
        "wrapResponses": false,
        "wrapResponseMethods": [
          "GetAsync",
          "PostAsync"
        ],
        "generateResponseClasses": false,
        "responseClass": "ApiResponse"
      },
      "swaggerToTypeScriptClient": {
        "namespace": "MyCompany.Api.Client",
        "dateTimeType": "Date",
        "wrapDtoExceptions": false,
        "operationGenerationMode": "SingleClientFromPathSegments",
        "generateCloneMethod": true,
        "generateDefaultValues": true,
        "excludedTypeNames": [
          "IEnumerable",
          "Task"
        ],
        "handleReferences": true,
        "generateConstructorInterface": false,
        "baseUrlTokenName": "BaseUrl",
        "output": "src/api.service.ts",
        "className": "ApiService",
        "generateDtoTypes": true,
        "generateClientInterfaces": true,
        "generateClientClasses": true,
        "generateOptionalParameters": true,
        "wrapResponses": false,
        "wrapResponseMethods": [
          "get",
          "post"
        ],
        "generateResponseClasses": false,
        "responseClass": "ApiResponse",
        "template": "Angular",
        "promiseType": "Promise",
        "clientBaseClass": "BaseApiClient",
        "configurationClass": "ApiConfiguration",
        "useTransformOptionsMethod": true,
        "useTransformResultMethod": false,
        "protectedMethods": [
          "getAuthToken"
        ],
        "useGetBaseUrlMethod": true,
        "queryNullValue": "null",
        "httpClass": "HttpClient",
        "rxJsVersion": 6,
        "useSingletonProvider": false,
        "injectionTokenType": "InjectionToken",
        "markOptionalProperties": true,
        "typeScriptVersion": 4.5,
        "moduleName": "my-api-client",
        "nullValue": "null",
        "typeStyle": "Class"
      }
    }
  }
